class Solution {
    public List<Integer> maximum(List<Integer> arr, int k) {
    // The idea is to use a k-size heap to store the biggest k elements.
        // However, it is not straight-forward to use a max-heap to store the
        // smallest k elements.
        // Thus, we can use a min-heap to store the biggest k elements in the
        // following way:
        // Pop the min element.
        // Then, push the maximum element of the remaining elements.
